OL,3,GNEWSACinema-goer claims she saw rat
OL,4,A'size of squirrel'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has said she and her boyfriend
OL,7,Fwere "disgusted" after spotting "a rat
OL,8,Fthe size of a squirrel" on their trip
OL,9,Fto a cinema.
OL,11,FFaye Hughes, 22, from Wythenshawe,
OL,12,FManchester, said she and her partner
OL,13,FElliot Hedges, 22, were at Cineworld in
OL,14,FDidsbury when this happened during a
OL,15,Flate night screening on Wednesday.
OL,17,FShe said she complained to the manager
OL,18,Fwho told her they were aware of the
OL,19,Fissue and were working with Manchester
OL,20,FCity Council to address it.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
